// 雁门（pxyanmen，州郡技能）：当你获得此技能后，你从牌堆中获得一张武器牌和一张
// 进攻坐骑牌。
// 上游 (sp/skill.js:1117)：trigger player:changeSkillsAfter；filter = addSkill 含本技；
// forced；content = gain(cardPile2(equip1 武器) + cardPile2(equip4 进攻坐骑))。
// 实现：skill_added + owner_skill_added_self_3339454948 → gain_card_by_kind(self,
// weapon) + gain_card_by_kind(self, horse_off)（武器与进攻马分别从牌堆/弃牌堆检索）。
skill pxyanmen(3339454948) {
  trigger skill_added owner_skill_added_self_3339454948 {
    effect gain_card_by_kind(self, weapon);
    effect gain_card_by_kind(self, horse_off);
  }
}
